        "abstract": "This paper proposes a traceability approach for crosscutting concerns. This approach provides a tracing semantics that allows us to identify the tracing links between the source and target elements as well as their transformation rules. These rules are verified for completeness and consistency in order to control and support the evolution of crosscutting concerns. The Health Watcher [3] case study is used to illustrate our approach.",
